# Rapport d'Architecture - ERP Gestion d'Entrepôt et Logistique avec Suivi GPS

---

## 1. Setup & Stack Technique

### Frontend
- React.js 18.x
- TypeScript 5.x
- Redux Toolkit (state management)
- React Query (data fetching)
- Tailwind CSS (styling)
- Leaflet / Mapbox GL JS (cartographie GPS)
- Socket.io-client (real-time)
- Axios (HTTP client)
- React Router v6

### Backend
- Node.js 20.x LTS
- NestJS 10.x (framework)
- TypeScript 5.x
- Prisma ORM (accès BDD)
- JWT (authentification)
- Passport.js (stratégies auth)
- Socket.io (real-time)
- Bull (queue jobs)
- Redis 7.x (cache, sessions, queues)

### Base de Données
- PostgreSQL 15.x (principale)

### Déploiement/DevOps
- Docker / Docker Compose
- Kubernetes (production)
- GitHub Actions (CI/CD)
- Nginx (reverse proxy)
- Terraform (IaC)
- AWS/GCP/Azure (cloud provider)

---

## 2. Schéma Relationnel de la Base de Données

### Tables et Entités

```
users
├── id (PK, UUID)
├── email (UNIQUE)
├── password_hash
├── first_name
├── last_name
├── role (enum: admin, manager, operator, driver)
├── created_at
└── updated_at

warehouses
├── id (PK, UUID)
├── name
├── address
├── latitude
├── longitude
├── capacity
├── manager_id (FK → users.id)
├── created_at
└── updated_at

zones
├── id (PK, UUID)
├── warehouse_id (FK → warehouses.id)
├── name
├── type (enum: storage, receiving, shipping, quarantine)
├── created_at
└── updated_at

products
├── id (PK, UUID)
├── sku (UNIQUE)
├── name
├── description
├── category
├── weight
├── dimensions
├── created_at
└── updated_at

inventory
├── id (PK, UUID)
├── product_id (FK → products.id)
├── warehouse_id (FK → warehouses.id)
├── zone_id (FK → zones.id)
├── quantity
├── min_quantity
├── location_code
└── updated_at

suppliers
├── id (PK, UUID)
├── name
├── contact_email
├── contact_phone
├── address
├── created_at
└── updated_at

purchase_orders
├── id (PK, UUID)
├── supplier_id (FK → suppliers.id)
├── status (enum: pending, approved, received, cancelled)
├── total_amount
├── order_date
├── expected_delivery
├── created_by (FK → users.id)
├── created_at
└── updated_at

order_items
├── id (PK, UUID)
├── purchase_order_id (FK → purchase_orders.id)
├── product_id (FK → products.id)
├── quantity_ordered
├── quantity_received
└── unit_price

customers
├── id (PK, UUID)
├── name
├── email
├── phone
├── billing_address
├── shipping_address
├── created_at
└── updated_at

sales_orders
├── id (PK, UUID)
├── customer_id (FK → customers.id)
├── status (enum: pending, picking, packed, shipped, delivered, cancelled)
├── total_amount
├── order_date
├── shipping_method
├── tracking_number
├── created_by (FK → users.id)
├── created_at
└── updated_at

sales_order_items
├── id (PK, UUID)
├── sales_order_id (FK → sales_orders.id)
├── product_id (FK → products.id)
├── quantity
└── unit_price

vehicles
├── id (PK, UUID)
├── plate_number (UNIQUE)
├── type (enum: truck, van, forklift)
├── capacity
├── status (enum: available, in_transit, maintenance)
├── current_driver_id (FK → users.id, nullable)
├── created_at
└── updated_at

gps_tracking
├── id (PK, UUID)
├── vehicle_id (FK → vehicles.id)
├── latitude
├── longitude
├── speed
├── heading
├── timestamp
└── created_at

shipments
├── id (PK, UUID)
├── sales_order_id (FK → sales_orders.id)
├── vehicle_id (FK → vehicles.id)
├── driver_id (FK → users.id)
├── status (enum: prepared, dispatched, in_transit, arrived, delivered)
├── departure_time
├── estimated_arrival
├── actual_arrival
├── created_at
└── updated_at

inventory_movements
├── id (PK, UUID)
├── product_id (FK → products.id)
├── from_warehouse_id (FK → warehouses.id, nullable)
├── to_warehouse_id (FK → warehouses.id, nullable)
├── quantity
├── type (enum: receipt, shipment, transfer, adjustment, damage)
├── reference_type
├── reference_id (UUID)
├── performed_by (FK → users.id)
└── created_at

alerts
├── id (PK, UUID)
├── type (enum: low_stock, vehicle_issue, delivery_delay)
├── message
├── entity_type
├── entity_id (UUID)
├── acknowledged (boolean)
└── created_at

notifications
├── id (PK, UUID)
├── user_id (FK → users.id)
├── type
├── title
├── message
├── read (boolean)
└── created_at
```

### Relations

```
users 1-N warehouses (manager)
warehouses 1-N zones
warehouses 1-N inventory
zones 1-N inventory
products 1-N inventory
suppliers 1-N purchase_orders
users 1-N purchase_orders (created_by)
purchase_orders 1-N order_items
products 1-N order_items
customers 1-N sales_orders
users 1-N sales_orders (created_by)
sales_orders 1-N sales_order_items
products 1-N sales_order_items
vehicles 1-N gps_tracking
vehicles 1-N shipments
sales_orders 1-N shipments
users 1-N shipments (driver)
products 1-N inventory_movements
warehouses 1-N inventory_movements (from/to)
users 1-N inventory_movements (performed_by)
users 1-N notifications
```

